Package: fuluk-gateway
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: springycloveting <springycloveting@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), tmux, passwd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/springycloveting/fuluk
Description: Web gateway for managing AI CLI tmux sessions
 Fuluk Gateway exposes a token-protected HTTP API and web UI for creating,
 listing and interacting with AI coding CLI sessions (Codex, Claude Code,
 OpenCode) backed by tmux. State is stored in /var/lib/fuluk-gateway and
 configuration is read from /etc/fuluk-gateway/fuluk-gateway.env.
